# needs-native-review: Sera's one row, pay and new roles are confirmed by a person (Rye, 27 Nov 2026)
#: client/src/components/reviewInbox/SeraListRow.tsx
msgctxt "review inbox: Sera's one row"
msgid "Tick the ones to take and take them together. Sera's suggestions for pay and for new roles are in the list too. Nothing is taken without a person: pay, a new role apart from its circle, and anything marked Check first are each confirmed on their own."
msgstr "Marque las que quiera tomar y tómelas juntas. Las sugerencias de Sera sobre el pago y sobre roles nuevos también están en la lista. Nada se toma sin una persona: el pago, un rol nuevo separado de su círculo y todo lo marcado Revisar primero se confirman cada uno por separado."

# needs-native-review: the order of the review list, blocked first (QA, 28 Nov 2026)
#: client/src/pages/AdminReview.tsx
msgctxt "review inbox: the order of the list"
msgid "In each kind: what is blocked comes first, then what lapses soonest, then the oldest. What carries no date comes last, in the order its own queue keeps."
msgstr "En cada tipo: primero lo bloqueado, luego lo que vence antes, luego lo más antiguo. Lo que no lleva fecha va al final, en el orden que guarda su propia cola."

# needs-native-review: a long queue on the review list (QA, 28 Nov 2026)
#: client/src/pages/AdminReview.tsx
msgctxt "review inbox: more rows of one kind"
msgid "Show all {n}"
msgstr "Mostrar los {n}"

# needs-native-review: a long queue on the review list (QA, 28 Nov 2026)
#: client/src/pages/AdminReview.tsx
msgctxt "review inbox: a queue too long to list here"
msgid "This list stops here. The rest are on this queue's own page."
msgstr "Esta lista termina aquí. El resto está en la página propia de esta cola."

# needs-native-review: the one count when it is unknown (QA, 28 Nov 2026)
